╭─ keys and help ──────────────────────╮
│ Ctrl-a keys                          │
│   c     go to the console panel      │
│   t     the sessions tree: every     │
│         session, by group            │
│   p     the big picture: what every  │
│         session is doing             │
│   g     the agent spot: the session  │
│         open in the cockpit          │
│   /     find a session: type part of │
│         its name, Enter jumps        │
│   s     find a session in a full tab:│
│         type part of its name, Enter │
│                                      │
│ j/k scroll · q close                 │
╰──────────────────────────────────────╯
